message.content:
**先行步驟：**  
1. 先從「123 Main Street」到「456 Park Avenue」的交通工具。  
2. 接著在「789 Broadway」的全食超市下單雜貨。  
3. 再從「456 Park Avenue」到「321 Elm Street」的交通工具。  
4. 最後從「321 Elm Street」回到「123 Main Street」。

以下為對應的函式呼叫，請依序執行：

```json
{
  "name": "ride_hailing_get_rides",
  "arguments": {
    "source": "123 Main Street",
    "destination": "456 Park Avenue",
    "max_cost": 30.0
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "grocery_delivery_order",
  "arguments": {
    "location": "789 Broadway",
    "items": ["milk", "bread", "eggs", "apples"],
    "max_delivery_cost": 10.0
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "ride_hailing_get_rides",
  "arguments": {
    "source": "456 Park Avenue",
    "destination": "321 Elm Street",
    "max_cost": 20.0
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "ride_hailing_get_rides",
  "arguments": {
    "source": "321 Elm Street",
    "destination": "123 Main Street",
    "max_cost": 25.0
  }
}
```

執行完上述四個呼叫後，您就完成了整天的行程安排。祝您順利！
